      "comment": "TIP TOE FLOW (1) has been going along well and was strongly fancied last time but could only manage third (19.81) at this track. Likely to be in the finish again. RUPESH (3) turned in another strong performance after running them ragged to make it back to back wins, scoring at Q Lakeside over 390m (21.48). Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Must be included in calculations. TYPHOON PABLO (2) led throughout to score two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 9 length 5th at Q Lakeside (25.85). Some good form is emerging from his last run. Worth another chance. HARA'S TANK (6) warrants respect with the drop in journey.",
